# Not yet wired — post-task.tsx location fields are plain text for now
# (see the TODO(places) comment there). When implementing Places
# autocomplete, use the Places API (New) REST endpoints directly via
# fetch() (no native SDK needed): POST https://places.googleapis.com/v1/places:autocomplete
# with header X-Goog-Api-Key. Get a key from https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# with the "Places API (New)" enabled — reuse the same Google Cloud project as
# app/'s VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY (app/.env) if you want one key for both clients,
# or mint a separate one restricted to this app's bundle ID / package name.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_PLACES_KEY=your_places_api_key_here
